  "description": "Writes a DocWright Word document as an EPUB 3 e-book, with no third-party dependencies: a conforming OCF container with a package document, navigation document and one XHTML chapter per heading or section, validated against EPUBCheck. Title, language, identifier and modified date are settable and never invented from the clock, so the same document gives the same book. Export only: there is no EPUB reader. Most users should install the DocWright package instead, which includes this one.",
